# Don't keep auto-generated shaders in the repository for this project. This produces a lot of commit noise.
# Only provide the shader in HLSL for D3D on Windows and let the user generate them if they want to run the example on other platforms.
# This can be achieved by running `./BuildLinux.sh --compile-shaders` on Linux or `./BuildMacOS.command --compile-shaders` on Mac.
*.spv
*.vert
*.frag
*.metal